  - label: "Why visit Shanghai?"
    html: |
      <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split"><div class="split-media reveal"><img src="assets/img/dest-shanghai.jpg" alt="Shanghai" /><div class="seal-stamp" aria-hidden="true">上<br/>海</div></div><div class="split-copy reveal reveal-d1"><span class="eyebrow">City & Style</span><h2 class="display-h2">Why visit Shanghai?</h2><p>Shanghai is China's most cosmopolitan city — a place where 1920s art-deco mansions share a skyline with the world's second-tallest building, where French bakeries sit beside hole-in-the-wall noodle shops, and where the pace of reinvention never slows. It's the perfect beginning or ending to any China journey.</p><p>No other Chinese city mixes East and West, past and future, with quite this swagger — and its food scene is the country's most international.</p></div></div></div></section>
